  "limitations": [
    "Shared transport-free RSV1 codec only. Frozen byte grammar, canonical stored order, exact snapshots and independent raw/parsed and framed limits. #553 owns valuation integration and #727 owns durable rate revisions.",
    "Independently reviewed red reached 22 explicit unimplemented methods and 144 sentinel stops, with three codec controls plus 33 exact-numeric and 53 rate-snapshot passes. The admitted product passed all 25 codec and 86 compatibility cases with zero skips.",
    "Allocation-free borrowed scanning, prepared failure translation, pre-growth arithmetic, and the simultaneous scratch and index bounds are source-reviewed properties. Runtime observations cover the frozen synthetic bytes and exact numerical cases without allocator fault injection.",
    "The protected #204 integration preserves both approved source and test sets and combines the shared registration. Four admitted runners passed 25 codec, 26 rule, 33 exact-numeric and 53 rate-snapshot methods. Joint registered CTest passed all 51 owning cases at 30 seconds. FX-06 and NUM-04 remain partial. Final proof-head CI and protected merge are separate."
  ],
